# Modern Web Guidance (MWG)

For HTML/CSS and client-side JS UI work, follow `.agents/skills/modern-web-guidance/SKILL.md` **before** inventing patterns:

1. `npx -y modern-web-guidance@latest search "<2-5 word query>"`
2. `npx -y modern-web-guidance@latest retrieve "<id>"`
3. Apply guide fallbacks for non-Baseline Widely available features.

**Layer-0 boundary:** Never add `modern-web-guidance` to `package.json` dependencies. Never import it from `src/core/`. Skill + guides live under `.agents/skills/modern-web-guidance/`; runbook at `docs/runbooks/modern-web-guidance.md`; fail-closed gate `npm run mwg:gate`.
